# Copy to .env and fill in. Vite exposes only VITE_-prefixed vars to the app.

# -- Accounts (Supabase) ------------------------------------------------------
# Sign-in / sign-up / password recovery. Both vars must be set for account
# features to light up - when either is missing the app boots fine and simply
# hides the account screen (status "unavailable"). Supabase > Project Settings > API.
#
# The forgot-password flow uses the emailed code, not a link (an Overwolf window
# cannot receive a redirect), so Supabase > Auth > Email Templates > Reset
# Password must use {{ .Token }} instead of {{ .ConfirmationURL }}.
#
# Google sign-in is wired up but switched off: no provider button is rendered.
# To turn it on, enable Google under Supabase > Auth > Providers, allow-list
# peakmap://auth/callback under Auth > URL Configuration > Redirect URLs, and
# render GoogleButton again in the sign-in / sign-up forms.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
VITE_PEAK_CDN_BASE_URL=https://peak.ingredientassets.com/peak/data/peak
